# Club documents kept locally, never committed. The 2026-27 welcome packet and
# its renderer were deleted in aa3b539 because the packet embeds the club's real
# giving and budget figures. This repository is public; that content stays on
# disk (and in the private archive), not in source control.
docs/club-documents/
scripts/render-welcome-packet.sh

# Timestamped .env backups. On 2026-08-12 a `.env.local.bak-<ts>` created while
# blanking a key was swept into a commit by `git add -A` and pushed, exposing
# every production credential. `.env*` alone did not catch it because the
# existing rule did not anticipate a suffix after the extension.
.env.local.bak-*
.env*.bak
.env.local.*
*.env.bak
